Technical interviews are **not about how many problems you’ve solved** — they’re about **how quickly you recognize patterns**.

If you’ve solved hundreds of problems but still feel stuck in interviews, the missing link is **pattern mastery**. This blog breaks down the **core DSA patterns** that appear in **90%+ interview questions**, explained clearly with visual intuition.

