## Why Patterns Matter More Than Problems Solved

Solving 1500+ problems won’t help if every new problem feels unfamiliar.

### Pattern Recognition
Interview questions are rarely new. They reuse the **same core ideas** disguised in different problem statements.

### Faster Solutions
Patterns let you map new problems to known strategies, cutting thinking time dramatically.

### Hidden Connections
One pattern applies across arrays, strings, trees, graphs, and DP — learn once, apply everywhere.

