## Pattern 5: Binary Search

Binary Search is about **eliminating half the search space** each step.

### Key Variants
- Standard binary search
- First / last occurrence
- Rotated sorted arrays
- Binary search on answers

**Time Complexity:** O(log n)

![Binary Search](/images/blogs/mastering-dsa-patterns/binary-search.png)

